  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Young Brazilians to access their first job</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cepac intends to use access to the right to education, culture and work as a weapon to break the cycle of extreme poverty among young people, creating opportunities for income, economic growth and a life project. Currently, Cepac serves more than 600 children/adolescents in situations of vulnerability and social risk in SP/Brazil with free projects and programs aimed at reducing social inequalities, early pregnancy, drug use and abuse, informal work and involvement with crime.</narrative>
  </description>
